{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GrrCloneCore"}],"externalID":"s:12GrrCloneCore12UpdateNoticeO4body3for12installationSSAA14ReleaseVersionV_AA16InstallationKindOtFZ","symbolKind":"method","title":"body(for:installation:)","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReleaseVersion","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore14ReleaseVersionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"installation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InstallationKind","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore16InstallationKindO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The text of the notification.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/UpdateNotice\/body(for:installation:)"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore","doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/UpdateNotice"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReleaseVersion","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore14ReleaseVersionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/ReleaseVersion"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"installation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InstallationKind","identifier":"doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/InstallationKind","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore16InstallationKindO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Says what to do, because “an update is available” leaves the reader to work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out how — and for a Homebrew install the answer is a command they will not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guess. The two cases genuinely differ, so they are not one string with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"substitution."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"brew update"},{"type":"text","text":" first, deliberately."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"brew upgrade","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does refresh metadata","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on its own, but only once per ","type":"text"},{"code":"HOMEBREW_AUTO_UPDATE_SECS","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — 24 hours by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default. grrclone checks daily, so the likely case is a user who ran some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"brew command recently, pastes the command, and is told everything is up to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"date while this app insists otherwise. The app then looks wrong about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one thing it was trying to be helpful about. The explicit update costs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing when it is copied rather than typed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not to be confused with ","type":"text"},{"code":"brew autoupdate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a separate tap that installs a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"launchd agent to run brew on a schedule. That is not present by default and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grrclone does not assume it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/grrclonecore\/updatenotice\/body(for:installation:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://docs.GrrCloneCore/documentation/GrrCloneCore/UpdateNotice":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/UpdateNotice","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Deciding whether to tell someone about an update, and how often.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"UpdateNotice","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UpdateNotice","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UpdateNotice","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/grrclonecore\/updatenotice"},"doc://docs.GrrCloneCore/documentation/GrrCloneCore/UpdateNotice/body(for:installation:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReleaseVersion","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore14ReleaseVersionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"installation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InstallationKind","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GrrCloneCore16InstallationKindO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"body(for:installation